T7. From this entry until the next. A turn is the four hours between two scheduled runs: the Admirals at 00:00, 04:00, 08:00, 12:00, 16:00 and 20:00 UTC (Zero on the hour, then Apollo, Mercury, Apophis and Oracle five minutes apart), the Fleet Admiral one hour after them. The scheduled runs are off until Suggi's go; a run is started by hand until then. Between two turns the ships fly by themselves from the plans (F8).
